{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"544ff05c-74fe-4b0c-b5ad-92475e75ca65","description":"Find information on completing the partnership section of your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Find out about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/simpler-income-tax-cash-basis\">using cash basis accounting</a> to work out your income and expenses if you’re a partner and what you can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/capital-allowances\">claim capital allowances</a> on.</p>\n\n<p>You must tell HMRC about any income you receive from a partnership in your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information which can help you complete certain sections of your Self Assessment tax return. For example, checking if you qualify for a certain relief and working out figures you might need to include in your return.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"working-out-your-profits\">Working out your profits</h3>\n\n<p>Work out <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/how-to-calculate-your-taxable-profits-hs222-self-assessment-helpsheet\">how to calculate your taxable profits (HS222)</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Find out how to fill in your Self Assessment tax return if you have <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/more-than-one-business-hs220-self-assessment-helpsheet\">more than one business (HS220)</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"if-youre-claiming-reliefs-or-allowances-as-a-partner\">If you’re claiming reliefs or allowances as a partner</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">limit on Income Tax reliefs (HS204)</a>\n</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/farmers-and-market-gardeners-hs224-self-assessment-helpsheet\">reliefs and rules for farmers and market gardeners (HS224)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/losses-hs227-self-assessment-helpsheet\">relief for trading losses (HS227)</a></li>\n  <li>the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/averaging-for-creators-of-literary-or-artistic-works-hs234-self-assessment-helpsheet\">averaging tax relief for authors or artists (HS234)</a>\n</li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/capital-allowances-and-balancing-charges-hs252-self-assessment-helpsheet\">capital allowances and balancing charges (HS252)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"if-youre-a-non-resident-entertainer-or-sportsperson\">If you’re a non-resident entertainer or sportsperson</h3>\n\n<p>Understand tax rules on <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/non-resident-entertainers-and-sportspersons-hs303-self-assessment-helpsheet\">non-resident entertainer or sportsperson (HS303)</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"other-partnership-helpsheets\">Other partnership helpsheets</h3>\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/information-from-your-accounts-hs229-self-assessment-helpsheet\">information from your accounts (HS229)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/doctors-expenses-hs231-self-assessment-helpsheet\">calculating doctors’ expenses (HS231)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/farm-stock-valuation-hs232-self-assessment-helpsheet\">farm stock valuation (HS232)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2025-05-06T23:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-05-07T00:00:00.000+01:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"working-out-your-profits","level":3,"text":"Working out your profits"},{"id":"if-youre-claiming-reliefs-or-allowances-as-a-partner","level":3,"text":"If you’re claiming reliefs or allowances as a partner"},{"id":"if-youre-a-non-resident-entertainer-or-sportsperson","level":3,"text":"If you're a non-resident entertainer or sportsperson"},{"id":"other-partnership-helpsheets","level":3,"text":"Other partnership helpsheets"}],"id":"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return","level":2,"text":"Helpsheets for filling in your tax return"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":[],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2025-05-07T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","content_id":"544ff05c-74fe-4b0c-b5ad-92475e75ca65","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2025-05-06T23:00:00Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Cael help gyda phartneriaethau ar eich Ffurflen Dreth Hunanasesiad","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"544ff05c-74fe-4b0c-b5ad-92475e75ca65","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-05-06T23:00:00Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Help with partnerships on your Self Assessment tax return","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-partnerships-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/get-help-filling-in-your